DESCRIPTION:Patrick Hercamp (Sound & Fury) performs the Bard's work like yo
 u've never seen it before! This award-winning comedian condenses some of Sh
 akespeare's best loved tragedies\, characters and iconic dramatic moments i
 nto a blisteringly funny vaudeville romp. This show is for Shakespeare fans
